  "learning_policy": "Always load learning.md. Never include either CSV in full. Post Writer receives up to 10 most recent captions plus up to 5 topic matches and comments from all 13 historical rows and final excerpts when available; Post Quality Analyst receives up to 5 draft-keyword caption matches and comments from all 13 historical rows and original/final excerpts when available. Content Planner receives learning.md only, with optional date and opening-line metadata for posts from the last 60 days. Brief Qualifier, Competitor Scan, and Publish and Verify receive learning.md only. Use UTF-8 and a real CSV parser. Truncate each caption to at most 1,200 characters and keep total CSV-derived prompt material within an approximately 3,000-token budget; preserve all 13 feedback row IDs and mark shortened fields as excerpts. CSV captions carry no performance metrics; learning.md is authoritative for metrics. Preserve evidence IDs and reuse permissions.",
